      "text": "Lecanemab:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " starting regimen 10 mg/kg IV over about one hour once every 2 weeks. Donanemab: IV over about 30 minutes every four weeks: 350 mg, 700 mg, 1,050 mg, then 1,400 mg from the fourth infusion on."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
