       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Boxed warning:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " ApoE ε4 homozygotes have a higher incidence of ARIA, including symptomatic, serious and severe ARIA; test ApoE ε4 status before starting."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
